+// The fused Hamilton projection ([`QuaternionWeights::All`]'s execution path).
+//
+// `y_j = Σ_k W_jk ⊗ x_k` over quaternion blocks: the weight is the compact map
+// `[out/4, in/4, 4]`, the activation is `[.., in]` read as `in/4` quaternion
